{"id":"vod_bf_4539","vodId":"4539","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"超元气三姐妹第一季","name_cn":"超元气三姐妹第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第14集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-5/43efb59d65e9ba6fd40cdc15d587c80f.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《超元气三姐妹》改编自日本漫画家樱井纪雄原作的同名漫画。故事以丸井家就读小学六年级的三胞胎姐妹为中心，长女三叶是一个稍嫌早熟的虐待狂少女，以女王自居的她，认为所有的人都要对他服从。次女双叶是个有点色色的少女，头脑简单四肢发达的她，最喜欢的东西就是女人的胸部。三女一叶则是个有点不可思议的阴沉型少女，常被人误认是灵异少女，但是在家中的料理及家事都是由她负责。作品描述不只长的完全不一样，连个性也南辕北辙的三胞胎，在日常生活中与身边的人们所发生的搞笑趣事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:33:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisanjiemeidiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/chaoyuanqisan